Notebook[{Cell[
"\<Thermodynamics of the 4E-BP1 / eIF4F model: every derivation and calculation, step by step\>",
"Title",ExpressionUUID -> "58f24494-3928-4eb7-8fcb-fa926323e572"],Cell[
"\<Companion to: Harika GL, Sriram K. Staged 4E-BP1 phosphorylation creates two switches in series that give eIF4F memory (npj Systems Biology and Applications version). Each section names the equation, section, note or table of the manuscript that it derives or computes. Run the cells one by one, from the top (Shift+Enter), or all at once (Evaluation > Evaluate Notebook). Text in blue explains the cell below it. Units: concentrations in nM, first-order constants in 1/s, second-order constants in 1/(nM s).\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "273a64ad-3210-4a1e-8320-5ba304351251"],Cell[

"\<Map to the manuscript. Sections 1-4: Supplementary Note 2, Steps 1-6; Methods 4.2, Steps 1-4; Results 2.2, Eq (1). Section 5: Supplementary Note 2, Steps 7-8; Methods 4.2, Step 5. Section 6: Supplementary Table 5. Section 7: Methods 4.2, Step 6; Eq (2); Supplementary Table 7. Section 8: Results 2.6 (driving strength). Sections 9-11: Supplementary Note 3; Supplementary Figs 9-11; Supplementary Table 8. Section 12: the split parameter u, Supplementary Note 2, Steps 9-14; Supplementary Table 6; Methods 4.2.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "fae242f6-a2fc-474c-a711-fd8cc17e44fe"],Cell[

"\<0. Reference parameter set (Table 3, Methods 4.1; MATLAB model/p4e_ref.m)\>","Section",
ExpressionUUID -> "9b6c2577-c485-44af-a5ac-b14e556abb78"],Cell[
"\<Clear any earlier definitions so that the notebook can be rerun from the top.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "aedab339-ade5-4a76-8c49-4b6d4aa5110e"],Cell[

"\<ClearAll[\"Global`*\"]\>","Input",CellLabel -> "In[1]:= ",ExpressionUUID -> "8d97dfb4-dc7f-4867-9f56-2617583acde2"],Cell[

"\<The 22 forward and 22 backward rate constants of R1-R22 at the reference set, in the order R1, R2, ..., R22. The backward constants of the catalytic steps (R2, R4, ..., R16) and kb21 are the values computed below (Sections 5-7); they are listed here so that every check can be made against the numbers used in the simulations.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "c165dd3b-f29c-4584-a1e2-972fa628ecac"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<kfRef = {0.031, 0.0029, 0.1, 17.0, 0.023, 0.027, 0.03, 0.14, 0.1, 0.002, 0.013,
  30.0, 0.02, 0.24, 0.012, 0.15, 10.0, 0.095, 0.061, 0.076, 0.0065, 0.1};
kbRef = {0.11, 1.8118049126429878*10^(-8), 0.032, 5.248190926288552*10^(-6), 0.63,
  2.5119421075763224*10^(-5), 5.5, 8.671843526089229*10^(-8), 0.42,
  1.2059530144173232*10^(-8), 1.2, 7.161218699078797*10^(-6), 0.016,
  3.427574767082689*10^(-5), 3.1, 5.772054026273275*10^(-8), 0.0020408163265306124,
  2.565, 14.03, 4.256, 0.7208035714285713, 0.5};
Length /@ {kfRef, kbRef}\>",
"Input",CellLabel -> "In[2]:= ",ExpressionUUID -> "ed209368-dc96-41bd-b84b-e8349b22bad4"],Cell[
BoxData[
RowBox[{"{",RowBox[{"22",",","22"}],"}"}],StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[4]= ",
ExpressionUUID -> "0c551a6d-c7e0-4cc2-abd0-e1eb05305aa9"]},Open],ExpressionUUID -> "cca4e1e4-6b2b-47b0-b1e3-56a1959b29b6"],Cell[

"\<Gas constant, temperature (37 degC) and RT in kJ/mol (Methods 4.2: RT = 2.579 kJ/mol).\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "41af904e-d267-4174-b6c3-d8b5db7ab3d1"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<R = 8.314462618*10^-3; Tk = 310.15; RT = R Tk\>","Input",CellLabel -> "In[5]:= ",
ExpressionUUID -> "24fd5a5a-7d10-4616-85e2-e2007cbada8a"],Cell[
BoxData["2.5787305809727`",
StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[5]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "e5aa3ff0-67ee-41d2-ac02-8e96a3fdf3bf"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "950991e7-0995-4dff-88a2-b4c16f3b92c1"],Cell[
"\<1. One reversible reaction (Supplementary Note 2, Step 3; Methods 4.2, Step 1)\>",
"Section",ExpressionUUID -> "1b3eec75-b208-469e-9dff-6abf4e56053f"],Cell[
"\<A reversible elementary reaction A + B <-> AB with forward constant kf and backward constant kb. By mass action, the one-way rates are vplus = kf [A][B] and vminus = kb [AB]; the net rate is r = vplus - vminus.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "6d07a357-3c70-4ed5-a758-fd66b0c3e56d"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<vplus = kf a b; vminus = kb ab; r = vplus - vminus\>","Input",CellLabel -> "In[6]:= ",
ExpressionUUID -> "2b3c20d1-e5c3-4e3a-8de8-c6bcb31f1e27"],Cell[
BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[
{RowBox[{"-","ab"}]," ","kb"}],"+",RowBox[{"a"," ","b"," ","kf"}]}],StandardForm],
"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[6]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "edf0e39d-3aad-42b6-a344-608f5a52fab8"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "8f8c6867-efe1-4777-9123-c744920b09a6"],Cell[
"\<At equilibrium r = 0. Solving for [AB] shows that [AB]/([A][B]) = kf/kb: the equilibrium constant is K = kf/kb for the reaction as written (for binding, K = 1/KD).\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "df03c15f-bd3c-498e-aaaf-ae614a4057e3"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<Solve[r == 0, ab]
Keq = ab/(a b) /. First[Solve[r == 0, ab]]\>","Input",
CellLabel -> "In[7]:= ",ExpressionUUID -> "908c798b-d0d6-49a1-bbdb-905c213974cd"],Cell[
BoxData[
RowBox[{"{",RowBox[{"{",RowBox[{"ab","\[Rule]",FractionBox[RowBox[{"a"," ","b"," ","kf"}],
"kb"]}],"}"}],"}"}],StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[7]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "fa91865e-88fa-40cf-a517-d3584d5bb8c6"],Cell[
BoxData[
FractionBox["kf","kb"],StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[8]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "bd0005e8-5bae-47cf-aa22-4b68ac8f5fe1"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "99d3c513-4164-42d5-857f-08cb9555250e"],Cell[
"\<Free energy. With chemical potentials mu = mu0 + RT Log[c], DeltaG = DeltaG0 + RT Log[Q], DeltaG0 = -RT Log[K], Q = [AB]/([A][B]). The cell checks that DeltaG equals -RT Log[vplus/vminus] (the difference simplifies to 0; the second line checks it numerically with random positive values): a reaction runs forward exactly when its DeltaG is negative.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "ffb02956-7ac0-4a08-bdaa-8ef932001706"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<Q = ab/(a b); dG0 = -rt Log[kf/kb]; dG = dG0 + rt Log[Q];
Simplify[PowerExpand[dG - (-rt Log[vplus/vminus])]]
Chop[dG - (-rt Log[vplus/vminus]) /. Thread[{kf, kb, a, b, ab,
  rt} -> RandomReal[{0.1, 10}, 6]]]\>",
"Input",CellLabel -> "In[9]:= ",ExpressionUUID -> "a434040d-f453-4b94-85b2-3196cef599e0"],Cell[
BoxData[
"0",StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[10]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "f73e4593-f21b-47e6-be56-bc22a14b7994"],Cell[
BoxData[
"0",StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[11]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "1a63aa8a-3258-4fff-916e-68ebf57a5c43"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "2f6e417a-270b-4d30-b306-4cd6daf83e44"],Cell[
"\<2. Cycle 1: the four reactions and their one-way rates (Supplementary Note 2, Steps 1-2)\>",
"Section",ExpressionUUID -> "8bd5c3eb-be8c-40d2-b43b-bf876ad9cf84"],Cell[
"\<Cycle 1 is the first phosphorylation site. R1: BPe4E + kin <-> C1 (kinase binding). R2: C1 <-> BPe4Ep + kin (catalysis). R7: BPe4Ep + P <-> C4 (phosphatase binding). R8: C4 <-> BPe4E + P (dephosphorylation). Symbols: s0 = [BPe4E], s1 = [BPe4Ep], k = [kin], p = [P], c1 = [C1], c4 = [C4]. In Eq (1), a = R1, b = R2, c = R7, d = R8.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "cc543abb-7d1a-44f4-9ba0-a58fcdc27b45"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<v1p = kf1 s0 k; v1m = kb1 c1;
v2p = kf2 c1;   v2m = kb2 s1 k;
v7p = kf7 s1 p; v7m = kb7 c4;
v8p = kf8 c4;   v8m = kb8 s0 p;
TableForm[{{\"R1\", v1p, v1m}, {\"R2\", v2p, v2m}, {\"R7\", v7p, v7m}, {\"R8\", v8p, v8m}},
  TableHeadings -> {None, {\"reaction\", \"forward\", \"backward\"}}]\>",
"Input",CellLabel -> "In[12]:= ",ExpressionUUID -> "b47ff4f6-432a-4a0b-a2a1-85870a19fe2a"],Cell[
BoxData[
TagBox[TagBox[GridBox[{{TagBox["\"reaction\"",HoldForm],TagBox["\"forward\"",HoldForm],TagBox[
"\"backward\"",HoldForm]},{"\"R1\"",RowBox[{"k"," ","kf1"," ","s0"}],RowBox[{"c1"," ","kb1"}]},{"\"R2\"",RowBox[
{"c1"," ","kf2"}],RowBox[{"k"," ","kb2"," ","s1"}]},{"\"R7\"",RowBox[{"kf7"," ","p"," ","s1"}],RowBox[
{"c4"," ","kb7"}]},{"\"R8\"",RowBox[{"c4"," ","kf8"}],RowBox[{"kb8"," ","p"," ","s0"}]}},
RowSpacings -> 1,ColumnSpacings -> 3,RowAlignments -> Baseline,ColumnAlignments -> Left,
GridBoxDividers -> {"Columns" -> {{False}},"Rows" -> {False,True,{False},False}},
ColumnAlignments -> Left],{None,OutputFormsDump`HeadedColumns}],Function[BoxForm`e$,
TableForm[BoxForm`e$,TableHeadings -> {None,{"reaction","forward","backward"}}]]],
StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[16]//TableForm= ",ExpressionUUID -> "00ef4a35-ba1f-4baa-8018-d4f135ebb51d"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "169f01af-f8ff-490f-962f-e3c242239ec9"],Cell[
"\<Reaction quotients of the four reactions (products over reactants).\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "ce87414f-8ca7-4580-b2fd-e36bedc6bfa2"],Cell[

"\<q1 = c1/(s0 k); q2 = s1 k/c1; q7 = c4/(s1 p); q8 = s0 p/c4;\>","Input",CellLabel -> "In[17]:= ",
ExpressionUUID -> "f49eaf6b-e410-4661-9e8e-c8f7b938f67c"],Cell[
"\<3. Sum of the free energies around the cycle (Supplementary Note 2, Step 4; Eq S1)\>",
"Section",ExpressionUUID -> "61896cce-c0f2-4d9f-a696-feab8f2b6e45"],Cell[
"\<Adding the four free energies is the same as multiplying the four ratios vplus/vminus. Every concentration appears once above and once below the line and cancels, leaving only rate constants: this is Gamma1.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "2bf022da-2e24-4b9b-b4a5-b78ef0a20859"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<Gamma1 = Simplify[(v1p/v1m) (v2p/v2m) (v7p/v7m) (v8p/v8m)]\>","Input",CellLabel -> "In[18]:= ",
ExpressionUUID -> "2de47a1c-0ce8-4193-995a-f15b30e8c65b"],Cell[
BoxData[FractionBox[
RowBox[{"kf1"," ","kf2"," ","kf7"," ","kf8"}],RowBox[{"kb1"," ","kb2"," ","kb7"," ","kb8"}]],
StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[18]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "69689c10-b6b6-487a-8fd3-859a7b1d31be"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "c6f07e94-9170-4a03-92ca-e41e0c6a4895"],Cell[
"\<Check that no concentration is left: the result does not depend on s0, s1, k, p, c1 or c4. The cancellation holds at every instant; no reaction has to be at equilibrium.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "ef092c04-c8f2-42cd-a3db-f0902b0db2f7"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<FreeQ[Gamma1, s0 | s1 | k | p | c1 | c4]\>","Input",CellLabel -> "In[19]:= ",
ExpressionUUID -> "59f7bf9d-4c28-4cd6-ba84-57a1dcbeafe4"],Cell[
BoxData["True",StandardForm],
"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[19]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "4c82764e-f708-44d9-8114-b8e9bfeb6b7d"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "9a4ffd50-1176-4fd9-b5be-44b75bef2bca"],Cell[
"\<The sum of the four free-energy changes equals -RT Log[Gamma1] (Eq S1): the difference simplifies to 0, and is 0 numerically for random positive values.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "f7a7b70b-efd6-4331-8747-9639f3735bb4"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<sumdG = -rt (Log[v1p/v1m] + Log[v2p/v2m] + Log[v7p/v7m] + Log[v8p/v8m]);
Simplify[PowerExpand[sumdG - (-rt Log[Gamma1])]]
Chop[sumdG - (-rt Log[Gamma1]) /. Thread[{kf1, kb1, kf2, kb2, kf7, kb7, kf8, kb8,
  s0, s1, k, p, c1, c4, rt} -> RandomReal[{0.1, 10}, 15]]]\>",
"Input",CellLabel -> "In[20]:= ",ExpressionUUID -> "03a19b1c-f492-47cc-bc6e-23a7ee0ae4da"],Cell[
BoxData[
"0",StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[21]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "b78ff2e5-4d1b-4e3c-b1e7-e7968e101a65"],Cell[
BoxData[
"0",StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[22]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "e15def26-9b7c-41e3-845a-128e5c3c06a2"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "97207616-788d-4e9f-93eb-9138f29d4e20"],Cell[
"\<4. Half-cycles and ATP (Supplementary Note 2, Steps 5-6; Methods 4.2, Steps 3-4; Eq 1)\>",
"Section",ExpressionUUID -> "d6f028c8-1edb-43b8-967b-24fb0a5d7963"],Cell[
"\<Haldane relations: the kinase half-cycle (R1 then R2) converts BPe4E to BPe4Ep with overall constant Kkin = kf1 kf2/(kb1 kb2); the phosphatase half-cycle (R7 then R8) converts it back with Kp = kf7 kf8/(kb7 kb8). Their product is Gamma1.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "699f67f3-4130-4596-a8f2-2cb0ddbaf042"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<Kkin1 = (kf1 kf2)/(kb1 kb2); Kp1 = (kf7 kf8)/(kb7 kb8);
Simplify[Kkin1 Kp1 == Gamma1]\>",
"Input",CellLabel -> "In[23]:= ",ExpressionUUID -> "883dc629-ef61-4d01-8903-85ad6d538966"],Cell[
BoxData[
"True",StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[24]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "642dec05-5e11-448d-9fda-dbb78fb09b50"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "5eebacce-b52b-4366-9c64-28bf53bce386"],Cell[
"\<Where ATP enters. With the nucleotides explicit (primed constants), the kinase binds as kin-ATP and releases ADP at catalysis, and the phosphatase releases Pi. The model constants absorb the constant cellular levels: kf1 = kf1x [ATP], kb2 = kb2x [ADP], kb8 = kb8x [Pi]. With the nucleotides explicit the loop is closed and obeys detailed balance: its constant equals Khyd, the equilibrium constant of ATP hydrolysis.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "98cce75b-2c63-4da0-9a48-3d49c9d41dae"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<explicit = {kf1 -> kf1x atp, kb2 -> kb2x adp, kb8 -> kb8x pi};
GammaExplicit = Gamma1 /. explicit\>",
"Input",CellLabel -> "In[25]:= ",ExpressionUUID -> "9de1e45b-0cd7-4cfd-9573-ac40eed2dfbb"],Cell[
BoxData[
FractionBox[RowBox[{"atp"," ","kf1x"," ","kf2"," ","kf7"," ","kf8"}],RowBox[{"adp"," ","kb1"," ","kb2x"," ","kb7"," ","kb8x"," ","pi"}]],
StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[26]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "a33e88a7-a331-4616-96a9-4240462e9076"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "43b60559-405d-4c3e-b60c-a76dfcc0f5f9"],Cell[
"\<Impose detailed balance on the explicit loop (kf1x kf2 kf7 kf8/(kb1 kb2x kb7 kb8x) = Khyd) and express Gamma1 through ATP, ADP and Pi: Gamma1 = Khyd [ATP]/([ADP][Pi]) = Exp[DeltaGc/RT] (Eq 1).\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "6ddf47a1-a8ef-41fb-8d50-54b4cbdc733f"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<Simplify[GammaExplicit /. kf1x -> khyd kb1 kb2x kb7 kb8x/(kf2 kf7 kf8)]\>",
"Input",CellLabel -> "In[27]:= ",ExpressionUUID -> "b0aef262-3f29-49f3-80fb-27c4cbdc8563"],Cell[
BoxData[
FractionBox[RowBox[{"atp"," ","khyd"}],RowBox[{"adp"," ","pi"}]],StandardForm],"Output",
CellLabel -> "Out[27]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "c7c4dcc2-b75a-4d18-ad35-756473f41418"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "7f3361c2-b452-4334-abfb-fbee31b30837"],Cell[
"\<Size of DeltaGc. Illustration (Supplementary Note 2, Step 6): DeltaG0' of ATP hydrolysis = -30.5 kJ/mol, [ATP] = 3 mM, free [ADP] = 0.1 mM, [Pi] = 10 mM (concentrations in M for the standard state). DeltaGc = -DeltaG0' + RT Log[[ATP]/([ADP][Pi])].\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "993025c0-2baa-4811-9f88-6ab0ee44e2fb"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<dG0hyd = -30.5; atpM = 3*10^-3; adpM = 1*10^-4; piM = 10^-2;
ratio = atpM/(adpM piM)
dGc = -dG0hyd + RT Log[ratio]
lnGammaExample = dGc/RT\>",
"Input",CellLabel -> "In[28]:= ",ExpressionUUID -> "cddae3bb-7541-4b33-ab29-4ee053d0af93"],Cell[
BoxData[
"3000",StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[29]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "458f6040-7a95-49c2-9a6e-a6b1c272064e"],Cell[
BoxData[
"51.1462648892077`",StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[30]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "df46e276-7da1-434d-8417-6ee8cb8dab2a"],Cell[
BoxData[
"19.833892406827268`",StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[31]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "584aaba1-c747-46f8-a19c-a99ea15485b9"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "8bfa0753-bbd6-4f0f-b097-f0b96064c181"],Cell[
"\<The manuscript uses lnGamma = 19.8 for all four cycles: DeltaGc = RT x 19.8 (Methods 4.2, Step 4). The range DeltaGc = 50-55 kJ/mol corresponds to lnGamma = 19.4-21.3.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "7b8b4f5d-a52c-474b-a934-fc4c80a3c5cf"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<{RT 19.8, 50/RT, 55/RT}\>","Input",CellLabel -> "In[32]:= ",ExpressionUUID -> "4b1c1a48-4567-4a86-be0d-b8aa3dcd5955"],Cell[
BoxData[
RowBox[{"{",RowBox[{"51.05886550325946`",",","19.38938498225741`",",","21.328323480483153`"}],"}"}],
StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[32]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "b74b3acf-58bb-4af3-aac8-da69e4cd9bc0"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "5c8f8cbe-6f51-44bd-830e-b7eeca8dce15"],Cell[
"\<5. Cycle 1 with numbers: check and rebinding constants (Supplementary Note 2, Steps 7-8; Methods 4.2, Step 5)\>",
"Section",ExpressionUUID -> "cce2849b-3e0b-459c-a895-936a6832098e"],Cell[
"\<Reference constants of cycle 1 (Table 3).\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "907e8eda-c0eb-4548-8ae5-8da078b3b4c7"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<num1 = {kf1 -> kfRef[[1]], kb1 -> kbRef[[1]], kf2 -> kfRef[[2]], kb2 -> kbRef[[2]],
  kf7 -> kfRef[[7]], kb7 -> kbRef[[7]], kf8 -> kfRef[[8]], kb8 -> kbRef[[8]]}\>",
"Input",CellLabel -> "In[33]:= ",ExpressionUUID -> "dba75058-f4a3-484b-a751-04bc7dac2a73"],Cell[
BoxData[
RowBox[{"{",RowBox[{RowBox[{"kf1","\[Rule]","0.031`"}],",",RowBox[{"kb1","\[Rule]","0.11`"}],",",RowBox[
{"kf2","\[Rule]","0.0029`"}],",",RowBox[{"kb2","\[Rule]","1.8118049126429878`*^-8"}],",",RowBox[
{"kf7","\[Rule]","0.03`"}],",",RowBox[{"kb7","\[Rule]","5.5`"}],",",RowBox[{"kf8","\[Rule]","0.14`"}],",",RowBox[
{"kb8","\[Rule]","8.671843526089229`*^-8"}]}],"}"}],StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[33]= ",
ExpressionUUID -> "52e60303-e3a1-43d5-bf98-d64dedd72b46"]},Open],ExpressionUUID -> "eb7da434-e04e-4828-82eb-51377bcef021"],Cell[

