Open],ExpressionUUID -> "6fb63a27-1fa8-4e6c-84f2-da94b34ee136"],Cell[
"\<7. The scaffold loop (Methods 4.2, Step 6; Eq 2; Supplementary Table 7)\>",
"Section",ExpressionUUID -> "daf64cff-0cdf-4965-8679-fe2f2a4178a7"],Cell[
"\<eIF4F forms by two routes: R18 then R19 (e4E + e4G -> e4GE, e4GE + e4A -> e4F) or R20 then R21 (e4G + e4A -> e4GA, e4GA + e4E -> e4F). No ATP is used, so both routes must have the same overall equilibrium constant (Wegscheider condition, Gamma = 1): 1/(KD18 KD19) = 1/(KD20 KD21). Solving for KD21 gives Eq (2).\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "8403c696-586c-40fb-b847-072e01b6ae3f"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<Solve[1/(KD18 KD19) == 1/(KD20 KD21), KD21]\>","Input",CellLabel -> "In[45]:= ",
ExpressionUUID -> "88451eee-6281-4055-a631-7784939c5ad3"],Cell[
BoxData[RowBox[{"{",RowBox[
{"{",RowBox[{"KD21","\[Rule]",FractionBox[RowBox[{"KD18"," ","KD19"}],"KD20"]}],"}"}],"}"}],
StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[45]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "4c261ead-1833-45d8-8102-cc8db8cdabc8"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "48a418de-ec4d-4316-868f-e8a896180c5a"],Cell[
"\<Numbers: KD = kb/kf for these binding reactions; KD18 = 27, KD19 = 230, KD20 = 56 nM give KD21 = 110.9 nM and kb21 = KD21 kf21.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "7cd7091f-7992-4d2c-abe4-1cec185e13a6"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<{KD18n, KD19n, KD20n} = Table[kbRef[[i]]/kfRef[[i]], {i, 18, 20}]
KD21n = KD18n KD19n/KD20n
kb21n = KD21n kfRef[[21]]
{kb21n/kbRef[[21]], KD20n KD21n/(KD18n KD19n)}\>",
"Input",CellLabel -> "In[46]:= ",ExpressionUUID -> "e0dd81ad-022c-45f4-9ed6-ee0587072144"],Cell[
BoxData[
RowBox[{"{",RowBox[{"27.`",",","229.99999999999997`",",","56.00000000000001`"}],"}"}],
