Open],ExpressionUUID -> "b71a62b7-c6d8-4a4e-ab2d-55356d924460"],Cell[
"\<8. Driving strength in kJ/mol (Results 2.6)\>",
"Section",ExpressionUUID -> "496b25c9-15a1-4497-b2ea-93175f1f4b7e"],Cell[
"\<The network becomes bistable at lnGamma = 4.9 and tristable at lnGamma = 10.8 (Results 2.6, computed by MATLAB M06). Converted to free energy: 12.6 and 27.8 kJ/mol. The reference lnGamma = 19.8 is about 9 RT above the minimum for tristability, and 19.8/10.8 = 1.8 times it.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "fcdc4427-3e0d-4a41-90fd-f7a5003cb0e3"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<{4.9 RT, 10.8 RT, 19.8 - 10.8, 19.8/10.8}\>","Input",CellLabel -> "In[50]:= ",
ExpressionUUID -> "dca6f778-dbfa-4a81-b597-00a896adb0cb"],Cell[
BoxData[RowBox[{"{",RowBox[
{"12.63577984676623`",",","27.85029027450516`",",","9.`",",","1.8333333333333333`"}],"}"}],
StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[50]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "4866cb27-36de-4594-8777-3905facc826a"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "3f7f9091-44f1-4012-9951-8496aebdcf8a"],Cell[
"\<9. Stoichiometric matrix of R1-R22 (Supplementary Note 3)\>",
"Section",ExpressionUUID -> "3e0b5495-b56b-46c1-8fbd-90b6838b5d4b"],Cell[
"\<Species, in the order of the MATLAB code (p4e_ssa_tables): kin, P, e4E, BP, e4G, e4A, S0 (BPe4E), S1, S2, S3, S4, BPp4, C1-C8, e4GE, e4GA, e4F. Each reaction is {reactants, products} as species numbers.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "6a20fb58-d212-4f5c-a765-bc6124114b94"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<species = {\"kin\", \"P\", \"e4E\", \"BP\", \"e4G\", \"e4A\", \"S0\", \"S1\", \"S2\", \"S3\", \"S4\",
  \"BPp4\", \"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C4\", \"C5\", \"C6\", \"C7\", \"C8\", \"e4GE\", \"e4GA\", \"e4F\"};
rx = {{{7, 1}, {13}}, {{13}, {8, 1}}, {{8, 1}, {14}}, {{14}, {9, 1}}, {{9, 2},
  {15}}, {{15}, {8, 2}}, {{8, 2}, {16}}, {{16}, {7, 2}},
  {{9, 1}, {17}}, {{17}, {10, 1}}, {{10, 1}, {18}}, {{18}, {11, 1}}, {{11, 2},
  {19}}, {{19}, {10, 2}}, {{10, 2}, {20}}, {{20}, {9, 2}},
  {{11}, {3, 12}}, {{3, 5}, {21}}, {{21, 6}, {23}}, {{5, 6}, {22}}, {{22, 3}, {23}},
  {{4, 3}, {7}}};
Length[rx]\>",
"Input",CellLabel -> "In[51]:= ",ExpressionUUID -> "41a3ea57-4fa3-4afe-b4a7-d2557305951e"],Cell[
BoxData[
"22",StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[53]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "22a4a018-41eb-49db-87f7-537538b83123"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "34579801-3f3e-4098-8850-e299a01c93f7"],Cell[
"\<Stoichiometric matrix S: one row per reaction, one column per species; -1 for a reactant, +1 for a product.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "85a8181d-55b1-4495-a2b5-bde4afdd6940"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<S = Table[Table[Count[rx[[j, 2]], s] - Count[rx[[j, 1]], s], {s, 23}], {j, 22}];
{Dimensions[S], MatrixRank[S]}\>",
"Input",CellLabel -> "In[54]:= ",ExpressionUUID -> "bb75c932-e2d5-4e52-9d1f-5b3918a0bdad"],Cell[
BoxData[
RowBox[{"{",RowBox[{RowBox[{"{",RowBox[{"22",",","23"}],"}"}],",","17"}],"}"}],StandardForm],
"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[55]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "65bbc930-e8f3-4042-a3e0-eae99bcbcb95"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "f1a5cf87-3615-4096-bad6-65f82034a2ef"],Cell[
"\<Rank 17: 23 - 17 = 6 conservation relations (total kinase, phosphatase, eIF4E, 4E-BP, eIF4G, eIF4A) and 22 - 17 = 5 independent loops.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "76319f8c-b292-4fa1-b3b1-a6e494d9fedb"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<{23 - MatrixRank[S], 22 - MatrixRank[S]}\>","Input",CellLabel -> "In[56]:= ",
ExpressionUUID -> "87725755-1d3e-46c8-bfbc-a20e9185c167"],Cell[
BoxData[RowBox[{"{",RowBox[
{"6",",","5"}],"}"}],StandardForm],"Output",CellLabel -> "Out[56]= ",ExpressionUUID -> "8fdb49c2-8426-4d97-9617-d63a253d8bb3"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "223b6cdc-94ba-454c-a95c-063144fff70f"],Cell[
"\<10. Loops by row reduction of [S | I] (Stanbury and Hoffman; Supplementary Note 3, Supplementary Fig 9A)\>",
"Section",ExpressionUUID -> "96b0c562-edfd-4d3f-8721-726342ce9d89"],Cell[
"\<Append the 22 x 22 identity matrix to S and row-reduce. Rows whose S-part (first 23 columns) is zero give, in the identity part, a loop: a combination of reactions with no net change of any species.\>",
"Text",FontColor -> RGBColor[0,0,1],ExpressionUUID -> "e154c8fb-3180-4197-ad4c-a5631af7a86f"],Cell[
CellGroupData[
{Cell[
"\<rr = RowReduce[Join[S, IdentityMatrix[22], 2]];
loops = Select[rr, AllTrue[#[[1 ;; 23]], # == 0 &] &][[All, 24 ;;]];
Dimensions[loops]\>",
