  \"lnKkin0, lnKP0\", \"lnKkin, lnKP\", \"RT lnK (kJ/mol)\", \"max |u|\", \"a\", \"c\", \"d\",
  \"b\", \"K/P window, low\", \"K/P window, high\", \"window width (decades)\"},
  {\"cycle 1\", \"cycle 2\", \"cycle 3\", \"cycle 4\"}}]\>",
